From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 08:25:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(mcp): add ORD announcement ingestion and read-only MCP
 worker

First vertical slice of the AI4X MCP spec for NTPU AIA, deployed
separately from the production chatbot:

- ingest worker (cron): allowlisted strapi fetch, raw snapshot to R2,
  normalize + Zod validation, SHA-256 diff, versioned transactional
  publish to D1, safe disappearance policy and drift detection
- MCP worker: stateless /mcp with search_announcements and
  get_announcement (read-only, provenance on every result), /health
  with freshness, /about
- tests for spec cases T-001..T-010, SSRF/size/redirect limits and the
  MCP contract; CI workflow and a manual staging deploy workflow

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
